TEXT -288 288 Left 2 ;SQ1, SQ2 = Q1, Q2 as ideal switches (Ron 1 mohm)\nL1 DCR 7 mohm\nC6_9 = C6-C9, 4 x 22 µF ceramic (about 40 µF at 12 V)
